<title>SWEDEN: Swedish May trade surplus 11.1 billion SKR.</title>
<headline>Swedish May trade surplus 11.1 billion SKR.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's May trade surplus was 11.1 billion crowns, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p> SWEDISH TRADE BALANCE     May 97    April 97   May 96</p>
<p> Exports			 50.2	 57.6	 48.2</p>
<p> Imports			 39.1	 45.3	 36.8</p>
<p> Trade balance		 11.1	 12.3	 11.4</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of crowns. Analysts polled by Reuters had forecast a 11.6 billion crown surplus.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, 46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
